# Node
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

# Python
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage

# Env & secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# 例外：apps/web/.env.production 由 scripts/gen-frontend-env.mjs 从 config/frontend.env 生成，
# 只含 VITE_ 公开前端配置（域名 / 文案），且 Vite 必须在构建期读到它，故必须进构建上下文。
# 真凭据一律不写这里（见 config/frontend.env 顶部说明）。
!apps/web/.env.production
config/dev.env
infra/nginx/ssl/*
!infra/nginx/ssl/.gitkeep

# Node (Taro)
**/.swc

# Docs / assets not needed in image
_local/
docs/
logs/
problem/
apps/api/logs/
apps/api/var/
*.zip
*.docx
*.png
*.jpg
*.json
!apps/web/**/*.json
!apps/api/**/*.json
*.md
*.bat

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
